comments.body:
@reporter Thanks for bringing this up. It does seem like the ONNX spec is being more restrictive than the version in the paper and PyTorch.
The current ONNXRuntime implementation, though, follows the ONNX spec with per-group scale and bias. What you linked to above seems to be the `com.microsoft.GroupNorm` op. 

To determine next steps, I think it would be useful to look at some practical use cases first. I'm wondering if you have some concrete models where per-channel scale and bias are needed?
